msgid "Optimization Stability and Sharpness · Phenomenon reproduction"
msgstr "优化稳定性与尖锐度 · 现象复现"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/keskar-fig2-3-sb-lb.md:10
msgid "Small-Batch vs. Large-Batch Training"
msgstr "小 batch 与大 batch 训练"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/keskar-fig2-3-sb-lb.md:13
msgid ""
"Both regimes fit the training set, but the large-batch solution "
"generalizes worse and is sharper along the sampled parameter path."
msgstr "两种训练都能拟合训练集，但大 batch 解的泛化能力较差，且在采样的参数路径上更为尖锐。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/keskar-fig2-3-sb-lb.md:22
msgid "WJ"
msgstr "金鑫"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/keskar-fig2-3-sb-lb.md:27
msgid "Author"
msgstr "作者"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/keskar-fig2-3-sb-lb.md:35
msgid "Scope"
msgstr "范围"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/keskar-fig2-3-sb-lb.md:37
msgid "**Phenomenon reproduction**"
msgstr "**现象复现**"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/keskar-fig2-3-sb-lb.md:39
msgid "Abstract"
msgstr "摘要"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/keskar-fig2-3-sb-lb.md:42
msgid ""
"This example uses Comfy Research to reproduce the central experiments "
"from Keskar et al. on the large-batch training generalization gap and "
"sharp minima. This is a qualitative reproduction; it does not claim "
"point-by-point or numeric replication of the paper's curves."
msgstr ""
"本示例使用 Comfy Research 复现 Keskar 等人关于大 batch 训练泛化差距与尖锐极小值的核心实验。"
"这是一项定性复现，并不声称逐点或在数值上复刻论文中的曲线。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/keskar-fig2-3-sb-lb.md:48
msgid ""
"**Paper:** [On Large-Batch Training for Deep "
"Learning](https://arxiv.org/abs/1609.04836)"
msgstr ""
"**论文：** [On Large-Batch Training for Deep "
"Learning](https://arxiv.org/abs/1609.04836)"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/keskar-fig2-3-sb-lb.md:50
msgid "**Template:** `repro: Keskar Fig 2+3 SB/LB`"
msgstr "**模板：** `repro: Keskar Fig 2+3 SB/LB`"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/keskar-fig2-3-sb-lb.md:52
msgid "**Template ID:** `repro-keskar-fig23-sb-lb`"
msgstr "**模板 ID：** `repro-keskar-fig23-sb-lb`"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/keskar-fig2-3-sb-lb.md:54
msgid "Reproduction Goal"
msgstr "复现目标"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/keskar-fig2-3-sb-lb.md:56
msgid ""
"Keskar et al. compare small-batch (SB) and large-batch (LB) training. "
"Both can reach very high training accuracy, but LB commonly shows lower "
"test accuracy, creating a generalization gap. The paper relates this "
"phenomenon to LB being more likely to converge to a sharp minimum that is"
" sensitive to parameter perturbations."
msgstr ""
"Keskar 等人比较小 batch（SB）与大 batch（LB）训练。两者都能获得很高的训练准确率，"
"但 LB 的测试准确率通常更低，因而产生泛化差距。论文将这一现象与 LB 更容易收敛到尖锐极小值联系起来："
"这类极小值对参数扰动更敏感。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/keskar-fig2-3-sb-lb.md:62
msgid ""
"The current template follows the CIFAR-10 with C1 path and contains two "
"parts:"
msgstr "当前模板沿用 CIFAR-10 上的 C1 设置，包含两部分："

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/keskar-fig2-3-sb-lb.md:64
msgid "**Figure 2:** Compare SB and LB train/test accuracy."
msgstr "**图 2：** 比较 SB 和 LB 的训练/测试准确率。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/keskar-fig2-3-sb-lb.md:65
msgid ""
"**Figure 3:** Interpolate parameters between the SB and LB checkpoints, "
"then evaluate loss and accuracy along the one-dimensional path."
msgstr "**图 3：** 在 SB 与 LB 的 checkpoint 之间插值参数，再沿这条一维路径评估损失和准确率。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/keskar-fig2-3-sb-lb.md:68
msgid "Experiment Configuration"
msgstr "实验配置"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/keskar-fig2-3-sb-lb.md:70
msgid ""
"The two Trainers share the same data, model architecture, initialization "
"seed, optimizer, and objective. Only the batch size and corresponding "
"number of optimizer steps differ."
msgstr "两个 Trainer 使用相同的数据、模型架构、初始化 seed、优化器和目标函数；仅 batch size 与相应的优化器步数不同。"

