#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/keskar-fig2-3-sb-lb.md:84
msgid ""
"Figure 3 uses the checkpoint produced by each Trainer. The parameter path"
" is:"
msgstr "图 3 使用各 Trainer 生成的 checkpoint。参数路径为："

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/keskar-fig2-3-sb-lb.md:86
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\theta(\\alpha) = \\theta_{SB} + \\alpha(\\theta_{LB} - \\theta_{SB})\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\theta(\\alpha) = \\theta_{SB} + \\alpha(\\theta_{LB} - \\theta_{SB})\n"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/keskar-fig2-3-sb-lb.md:90
msgid ""
"Here, $\\alpha=0$ corresponds to SB and $\\alpha=1$ corresponds to LB. "
"The template samples 25 points over $[-1, 2]$. Along this path, trainable"
" parameters are interpolated; evaluation uses per-batch BatchNorm "
"statistics."
msgstr ""
"其中 $\\alpha=0$ 对应 SB，$\\alpha=1$ 对应 LB。模板在 $[-1, 2]$ 区间采样 25 个点。"
"沿该路径对可训练参数进行插值；评估时使用每个 batch 的 BatchNorm 统计量。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/keskar-fig2-3-sb-lb.md:94
msgid "Run in Comfy Research"
msgstr "在 Comfy Research 中运行"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/keskar-fig2-3-sb-lb.md:96
msgid "Open Templates and load `repro: Keskar Fig 2+3 SB/LB`."
msgstr "打开 Templates，加载 `repro: Keskar Fig 2+3 SB/LB`。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/keskar-fig2-3-sb-lb.md:97
msgid ""
"Run **Train** on `Trainer SB (B=256)` to produce the SB checkpoint and "
"train/test accuracy curves."
msgstr "在 `Trainer SB (B=256)` 上运行 **Train**，生成 SB checkpoint 及训练/测试准确率曲线。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/keskar-fig2-3-sb-lb.md:99
msgid ""
"Run **Train** on `Trainer LB (B=5000)` to produce the LB checkpoint and "
"its curves."
msgstr "在 `Trainer LB (B=5000)` 上运行 **Train**，生成 LB checkpoint 及相应曲线。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/keskar-fig2-3-sb-lb.md:101
msgid ""
"Compare the two sets of train/test accuracy curves in `Fig 2 accuracy "
"plot`."
msgstr "在 `Fig 2 accuracy plot` 中比较两组训练/测试准确率曲线。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/keskar-fig2-3-sb-lb.md:103
msgid ""
"After confirming that both checkpoints are ready, run **Run** on `Fig 3 "
"parametric path`."
msgstr "确认两个 checkpoint 都已就绪后，在 `Fig 3 parametric path` 上运行 **Run**。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/keskar-fig2-3-sb-lb.md:105
msgid ""
"In `Fig 3 path plot`, inspect how train/test loss and accuracy change "
"with $\\alpha$."
msgstr "在 `Fig 3 path plot` 中查看训练/测试损失和准确率如何随 $\\alpha$ 变化。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/keskar-fig2-3-sb-lb.md:108
msgid ""
"The two Trainers are independent; no manual rewiring is needed. They "
"write separate SB and LB checkpoints and append their curves to the "
"Figure 2 series table."
msgstr "两个 Trainer 相互独立，无需手动重新连线。它们分别写入 SB 和 LB checkpoint，并将曲线追加到图 2 的序列表。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/keskar-fig2-3-sb-lb.md:112
msgid "Results"
msgstr "结果"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/keskar-fig2-3-sb-lb.md:114
msgid "Figure 2: A Generalization Gap Appears"
msgstr "图 2：出现泛化差距"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/keskar-fig2-3-sb-lb.md:116
msgid ""
"Both runs eventually reach train accuracy close to 1.0, indicating that "
"SB and LB both fit the training set well. In the completed run, SB test "
"accuracy is generally higher and stabilizes at approximately 0.77-0.78, "
"while LB test accuracy stabilizes at approximately 0.74-0.76."
msgstr ""
"两次运行最终的训练准确率都接近 1.0，表明 SB 和 LB 都很好地拟合了训练集。完成运行后，"
"SB 的测试准确率通常更高，稳定在约 0.77–0.78；LB 的测试准确率则稳定在约 0.74–0.76。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/keskar-fig2-3-sb-lb.md:121
msgid ""
"This result qualitatively reproduces the main observation from Figure 2: "
"LB does not perform worse because it failed to fit the training data. Its"
" training accuracy is also high, but its test performance is slightly "
"lower."
msgstr "这一结果定性复现了图 2 的主要观察：LB 表现较差并非因为未能拟合训练数据。它的训练准确率同样很高，"
"但测试表现略低。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/keskar-fig2-3-sb-lb.md:125
msgid ""
"Comfy Research graph and result plots showing small-batch and large-batch"
" accuracy, plus the Figure 3 parameter path."
msgstr "Comfy Research 的图与结果图，展示小 batch 和大 batch 的准确率，以及图 3 的参数路径。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/keskar-fig2-3-sb-lb.md:130
msgid "Figure 3: The LB Endpoint Is Sharper Along the Parameter Path"
msgstr "图 3：参数路径上的 LB 端点更尖锐"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/keskar-fig2-3-sb-lb.md:132
msgid ""
"The parameter-path run produces four series: train/test loss and "
"accuracy. Near $\\alpha=0$ (SB), loss remains low and accuracy is "
"relatively stable. As the path approaches $\\alpha=1$ (LB), both loss and"
" accuracy change more abruptly. Extrapolating farther to $\\alpha>1$ "
"produces a clear rise in loss and a rapid drop in accuracy."
msgstr ""
"参数路径运行生成四条序列：训练/测试损失和准确率。在 $\\alpha=0$（SB）附近，损失保持较低，"
"准确率也相对稳定。路径接近 $\\alpha=1$（LB）时，损失和准确率的变化更为剧烈。继续外推至 "
"$\\alpha>1$，损失会明显上升，准确率则快速下降。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/keskar-fig2-3-sb-lb.md:138
msgid ""
"This asymmetric one-dimensional slice qualitatively reproduces the visual"
" feature in Figure 3: the low-loss region near the SB solution is wider, "
"while the LB solution is more sensitive to parameter perturbations along "
"this path. It supports the interpretation that the LB solution is "
"sharper, but one linear path cannot represent the complete high-"
"dimensional loss landscape or replace the paper's sharpness metric."
msgstr ""
"这一非对称的一维切片定性复现了图 3 的视觉特征：SB 解附近的低损失区域更宽，"
"而 LB 解沿此路径对参数扰动更敏感。这支持 LB 解更尖锐的解释；但单条线性路径无法代表完整的高维损失景观，"
"也不能取代论文的 sharpness 指标。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/keskar-fig2-3-sb-lb.md:145
msgid "Interpretation"
msgstr "结果解读"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/keskar-fig2-3-sb-lb.md:147
msgid ""
"This run completes two independent SB/LB training paths, two checkpoints,"
" the Figure 2 accuracy comparison, and the Figure 3 parameter-"
"interpolation workflow. The results qualitatively support the paper's two"
" main observations: LB can fit the training set well while obtaining "
"lower test accuracy than SB, and the LB solution is sharper than the SB "
"solution along the sampled parameter path."
msgstr ""
"本次运行完成了两条独立的 SB/LB 训练路径、两个 checkpoint、图 2 的准确率比较和图 3 的参数插值流程。"
"结果定性支持论文的两项主要观察：LB 能很好地拟合训练集，但测试准确率低于 SB；沿采样参数路径，"
"LB 解也比 SB 解更尖锐。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/keskar-fig2-3-sb-lb.md:154
msgid "Limitations"
msgstr "局限性"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/keskar-fig2-3-sb-lb.md:156
msgid ""
"The current result uses only the C1 network and a single initialization, "
"seed 0; it does not report variance across seeds."
msgstr "当前结果仅使用 C1 网络与单个初始化（seed 0），未报告不同 seed 之间的方差。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/keskar-fig2-3-sb-lb.md:158
msgid ""
"The paper also includes F1/F2 and C2-C4; the current template covers only"
" CIFAR-10 with C1."
msgstr "论文还包括 F1/F2 与 C2–C4；当前模板仅覆盖 CIFAR-10 的 C1 设置。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/keskar-fig2-3-sb-lb.md:160
msgid ""
"Figure 3 examines only one linear path between SB and LB. This is not "
"equivalent to the complete high-dimensional loss landscape."
msgstr "图 3 仅考察 SB 与 LB 之间的一条线性路径，并不等同于完整的高维损失景观。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/keskar-fig2-3-sb-lb.md:162
msgid ""
"The result verifies the reported qualitative phenomena. It provides no "
"point-by-point error or numeric alignment with the paper's original "
"figures."
msgstr "该结果验证了文中报告的定性现象，但未提供逐点误差，也未与论文原图作数值对齐。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/keskar-fig2-3-sb-lb.md:165
msgid ""
"These limitations mean the result should not be presented as a strict "
"numeric replication or a universal causal conclusion."
msgstr "因此，这一结果不应被表述为严格的数值复现，也不能据此得出普适的因果结论。"
